---
import Card from '../components/ui/Card.astro';
import Container from '../components/ui/Container.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Features" description="Explore Forge content modeling, presentation, quality, automation, and deployment features.">
  <Container class="space-y-10 pb-16">
    <header class="max-w-2xl space-y-3">
      <div class="badge badge-outline">Features</div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">The pieces needed to publish with confidence.</h1>
      <p>Forge combines a focused Astro site with explicit quality and maintenance contracts.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <Card size="lg"><h2 class="card-title">Shared content model</h2><p>One typed definition drives Astro collections and Sveltia CMS configuration, reducing schema drift between rendering and editing.</p></Card>
      <Card size="lg"><h2 class="card-title">Accessible UI foundation</h2><p>Semantic layouts, keyboard navigation, responsive DaisyUI components, local fonts, and light and dark themes work without client JavaScript.</p></Card>
      <Card size="lg"><h2 class="card-title">Discoverable content</h2><p>Canonical and social metadata, sitemap, RSS, manifest, crawler guidance, article routes, and a useful 404 page share base-aware URL helpers.</p></Card>
      <Card size="lg"><h2 class="card-title">Layered quality gates</h2><p>Formatting, code and content linting, spelling, unused-code analysis, TypeScript, unit coverage, browser tests, accessibility checks, Lighthouse, and dependency auditing expose focused failures.</p></Card>
      <Card size="lg"><h2 class="card-title">Secure repository automation</h2><p>Pinned actions, minimal permissions, CodeQL, dependency review, workflow analysis, Dependabot, and protected Pages deployment are ready to configure.</p></Card>
      <Card size="lg"><h2 class="card-title">Owned and portable source</h2><p>The generated project has no Forge runtime service. Its source, content, lockfile, hosting choice, and future direction belong to its maintainers.</p></Card>
    </div>
  </Container>
</BaseLayout>
